{"track":"r","category":"벡터·문자열","level":2,"title":"이름 형식 바꾸기","desc":"<p>이름과 성을 받아 <code>\"성, 이름\"</code> 형태로 돌려주는 <code>format_name(first, last)</code>를 만드세요. 예: <code>(\"Ann\", \"Lee\")</code> → <code>\"Lee, Ann\"</code></p>","solution":"format_name <- function(first, last) {\n  paste(last, first, sep = \", \")\n}\n","hint":"<p><code>paste(..., sep = 구분자)</code></p>","tests":[{"call":"format_name(\"Ann\", \"Lee\")","expected":"Lee, Ann","visible":true},{"call":"format_name(\"Bo\", \"Kim\")","expected":"Kim, Bo","visible":true},{"call":"format_name(\"\", \"X\")","expected":"X, ","visible":false},{"call":"format_name(\"Jun\", \"Park\")","expected":"Park, Jun","visible":false}],"starter":"format_name <- function(first, last) {\n  \n}\n","id":"r-328"}